    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      402.96,
      310.0,
      449.03
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by Land Acquisition Act,that the Government intends to acquire the following landswhich are required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      462.96,
      245.17,
      473.03
    ],
    "text": "Description of the lands to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      482.16,
      310.06,
      564.23
    ],
    "text": "Following allotments of land depicted as Lot No. 81 and 84in Extent of 0.0005 Hectare in cadaster map No. 620296 madeby Surveyor General, situated in Ratnapura (Within RatnapuraMunicipal Council area) Village of 152F Ratnapura Town WestGrama Niladari Division of Divisional Secretary's DivisionRathnapura in the District of Rathnapura in SabaragamuwaProvince.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      578.16,
      310.04,
      638.39
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 81Name of the land: Badalowita; Land Use: Road; Claimant:Government; First Claimant: Weerakoon Arachchige Jinadasaand Mahabaththana Ralalage Ranjani Menike Weerakoon ofNo. 255, Bandaranayaka Mawatha; Extent: 0.0001 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      312.96,
      562.04,
      373.19
    ],
    "text": "02. Lot No. 84Name of the land: Badalowita; Land Use: Road; Claimant:Government; First Claimant: Weerakoon Arachchige Jinadasaand Mahabaththana Ralalage Ranjani Menike Weerakoon ofNo. 255, Bandaranayaka Mawatha; Extent: 0.0004 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      387.12,
      561.93,
      445.19
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands on whichservitude is to be acquired are here by requested to appearpersonally, or by agent duly authorized in writing, before meat 10.00 a.m. on 27th day of March, 2019 at RathnapuraDivisional Secretariat.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      459.12,
      561.72,
      529.19
    ],
    "text": "Moreover, they are here by requested to notify to me inwriting with two duplicates on or before the 19th of March,2019 the nature of their interest in land, the particulars of theirclaims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands,the amount of compensation and details of the computationof such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
